      "question": "Last one, and it's the strange one. You have to leave this room and everything in it behind, except one thing. What do you keep?",
      "answers": {
        "Flash": "Oh, the jukebox\u2014no, wait, that's too easy. I'd keep the salt shaker on this table, because it's been through every bad date and good laugh with me tonight.",
        "Pro": "My dignity, for it\u2019s the only thing I truly own and carry within me, unburdened by the weight of possessions.",
        "Hermes": "I'd keep the memories we made here, the connections we shared, and the laughter that filled this room. Those are the things that truly matter and will stay with me forever.",
